prompt Close the round -- the loop infusion has to reach the prompt the loop actually runs, not only the fillable seed.
think The seed under recursion-prompts/ is the template a run is copied from; tools/l/launch-claude-season.rish prints the prompts an unattended season actually pastes. Infusing one and not the other leaves the law written where nobody reads it at run time.
think Both printed prompts already name the two prose meters, so the QA read belongs in the same clause -- one place a reader of either prompt already looks.
think Avoided every apostrophe in the added clause, since these strings escape a literal quote as a doubled one and a lone apostrophe is exactly what loop_prompt_parse refuses.
obs launch-claude-season.rish carries --effort max explicitly on every invocation and names no model id, so it inherits the settings.json reading and needs no entry on the declaring roster. Checked rather than assumed.
obs The card's Git nib had stood four commits stale across this round. Pinned in this work commit rather than in a pin-only follow-up.
